{"title": "Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)", "pageid": 29822, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Volo's_Ersatz_Eye_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png/300px-Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png/300px-Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Volo's Ersatz Eye</b> is a passive feature which gives a character the condition <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\">See Invisibility</a>, after they have undergone surgery from <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The damage wrought upon your ocular nerve during Volo's experiment is undone, allowing you to see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a> creatures. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_See_Invisibility\"> Condition: See Invisibility </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"See Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\">See Invisibility</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can see <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a> creatures within 9 m (30 ft).</li>\n<li>Creatures must succeed a <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or lose their Invisibility.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Agree to <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a>'s surgery during Acts One or Two.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The condition may appear to disappear and immediately return when doing a variety of things, such as swapping equipped items or taking a short rest. This does not appear to cause any problems.</li>\n<li>Unlike other companions, Wyll cannot agree to Volo's operation and thus cannot receive the feature.</li>\n<li>The DC is 8+Perception modifier</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<p>UID: <code>CAMP_Volo_ErsatzEye</code>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200912\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1060/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9571/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4080/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops coun